Third-party dataset notice
==========================

The images in data/triplet_crack_dataset/ are based on:

  Concrete Crack Images for Classification
  Çağlar Fırat Özgenel
  Mendeley Data, version 2
  DOI: 10.17632/5y9wdsg2zt.2
  https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/5y9wdsg2zt/2

The source dataset is available under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International license (CC BY 4.0):

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The positive directory contains transformations generated by this repository's
preprocessing script. The source dataset's attribution and license terms still
apply to the underlying images and their derivatives.
